        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/modern-warfare-4-beta-shot-crop-3.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>We're deep in the second and final session of the Call of Duty: Modern Warfare 4 beta. This open portion is available on one more platform - <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/platforms/switch-2\">Switch 2</a>, and can be accessed without the need for a pre-order. It also includes a sampler of Warzone's next Resurgence map and two Ground War maps, alongside all the maps and modes from the first beta weekend. None of that appears to have moved the needle, at least on Steam.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/call-of-duty-modern-warfare-4-beta-second-weekend-major-patch-steam-numbers\">Read more</a></p>",
